      equipment: '84-card Chinese domino pack (15 lakes playing-cards)\nChips for payment (optional)\nTable space',
      dealing: 'Pack shuffled and spread face down; players take one card at a time anticlockwise from dealer until all taken. Three players: 28 cards each; four players: 21 each.',
